<<if $ch12_ram_felled>>
    Ullari as "Herder" [sad]: The big one? That was Dorro's. Dorro's gone. Last winter. #line:ch12_bark_herder_001
<<else>>
    Ullari as "Herder" [neutral]: Mind the terrace road. Something drinks at the wall up there. #line:ch12_bark_herder_002
